#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:9
msgid "构建模型与使用要求"
msgstr "Build model and usage requirements"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:11
msgid ""
"应用拥有工程、工具链选择和 TOML；Nexus 提供可复用目标与显式装配。源码检出和安装 SDK 共用一份生产图，使应用不必进入平台开发工程。"
msgstr ""
"The application owns its project, toolchain selection and TOML; Nexus "
"supplies reusable targets and explicit assembly. Source checkouts and "
"installed SDKs share one production graph, so applications need not use the "
"platform development project."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:13
msgid "![构建目标与作用域](../assets/diagrams/build-targets.svg)"
msgstr "![Build targets and scopes](../assets/diagrams/build-targets.svg)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:13
msgid "构建目标与作用域"
msgstr "Build targets and scopes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:15
msgid "发现、装配、镜像"
msgstr "Discovery, assembly and images"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:17
msgid ""
"`find_package(Nexus CONFIG REQUIRED)` 验证来源并加载 "
"API；请求版本时只接受精确匹配，不解析装配或创建生产目标。`nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)` 解析唯一 "
"TOML、生成静态连接并建立平台。`nexus_add_firmware()` 创建镜像及其产物检查。"
msgstr ""
"`find_package(Nexus CONFIG REQUIRED)` validates the source and loads the "
"API; when a version is requested, only an exact match is accepted. It "
"neither resolves an assembly nor creates production targets. "
"`nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)` resolves the single TOML input, generates"
" static connections and creates the platform. `nexus_add_firmware()` creates"
" an image and its artifact checks."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:27
msgid ""
"这是外部应用的 CMake 入口片段，仍需完整 `assembly.toml`、`main.c` "
"和预先选定的工具链。首次操作见[应用教程](../tutorials/first-f407.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This is an external application's CMake entry fragment. It still requires a "
"complete `assembly.toml`, `main.c` and a toolchain selected in advance. For "
"the first run, see the [application tutorial](../tutorials/first-f407.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:29
msgid ""
"一个构建目录只有一个工具链和装配。工具链在 `project()` 前选定；平台验证 "
"CPU/FPU/ABI，不在启用语言后替换编译器。相同装配可有多个镜像；不同装配使用独立目录。"
msgstr ""
"A build directory has one toolchain and one assembly. Select the toolchain "
"before `project()`; the platform validates CPU/FPU/ABI rather than replacing"
" the compiler after languages are enabled. One assembly may produce multiple"
" images; different assemblies use separate directories."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:31
msgid ""
"`nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)` 只创建 CPU Runtime 库，与 Platform 互斥。应用自建 "
"executable，提供 startup、链接脚本和具体 provider，并显式调用 "
"`nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)`。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)` creates only a CPU Runtime library and is "
"mutually exclusive with Platform. The application creates its own "
"executable, supplies startup, the linker script and concrete providers, and "
"explicitly calls `nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)`."

