#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:0
msgid "应用库、最终镜像与执行策略"
msgstr "Application libraries, final images and execution policy"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:45
msgid ""
"Provider target 发布 `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` 和 "
"`NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`。Platform 通过 `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET` 指向实际 "
"provider；每个镜像独立创建 startup OBJECT，私有消费厂商头、器件宏与 HAL 配置。"
msgstr ""
"The provider target publishes `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` and "
"`NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`. Platform identifies the actual provider "
"through `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET`; each image creates its own startup OBJECT "
"that privately consumes vendor headers, device defines and HAL "
"configuration."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:47
msgid ""
"`Nexus::ABI` 传递必须一致的二进制使用要求，`Nexus::OS` "
"表示已选择的后端。运行库、`-nostartfiles`、链接脚本和资源检查附着最终镜像；应用诊断策略由应用自己决定。"
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::ABI` carries binary usage requirements that must agree; `Nexus::OS` "
"represents the selected backend. Runtime libraries, `-nostartfiles`, the "
"linker script and resource checks attach to the final image. The application"
" chooses its own diagnostic policy."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:49
msgid "配置、组件与裁剪"
msgstr "Configuration, components and selection"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:51
msgid ""
"TOML、事实和配置代码先冻结为不可变 IR，再原子发布一个 bundle。生成器输出配置、对象、factory 和公共需求，不维护 C "
"源码列表。CMake 按模式、IP 和公共需求选择实际翻译单元。"
msgstr ""
"TOML, facts and configuration code are first frozen into immutable IR, then "
"published atomically as one bundle. The generator emits configuration, "
"objects, factory and public requirements, not C source lists. CMake selects "
"actual translation units by mode, IP and public requirements."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:53
msgid ""
"普通组件直接使用 CMake target。需要静态绑定或厂商选择的组件共用 "
"`components/catalog.json`，叶目录创建目标。公共生成头的 API 需求与 bindings "
"的私有实现需求分别传播；未选重依赖不准备、不编译。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary components use CMake targets directly. Components requiring static "
"binding or vendor selection share `components/catalog.json`; leaf "
"directories create targets. API requirements of public generated headers and"
" private implementation requirements of bindings propagate separately. "
"Unselected heavy dependencies are neither prepared nor compiled."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:55
msgid "增量与失败"
msgstr "Incremental builds and failure"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:57
msgid ""
"普通 C 修改由 Ninja 和编译器依赖触发相关工作。TOML、选中事实或生成器改变重新配置；相同生成内容保留时间戳。无变化构建不应再 "
"configure、编译或链接。"
msgstr ""
"Ninja and compiler dependencies schedule work affected by ordinary C "
"changes. TOML, selected fact or generator changes trigger reconfiguration; "
"identical generated content retains timestamps. An unchanged build should "
"not configure, compile or link again."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:59
msgid ""
"配置拒绝或中断使旧生成结果失效。链接失败或取消撤销旧 BIN/资源报告；缺少声明产物时直接构建固件目标能够恢复。预算和检查器变化复核现有 "
"ELF，布局变化触发链接。"
msgstr ""
"Rejected or interrupted configuration invalidates previous generated "
"results. Failed or cancelled linking withdraws old BIN/resource reports; "
"building the firmware target directly restores missing declared artifacts. "
"Budget or checker changes recheck the existing ELF; layout changes trigger "
"linking."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/build-model.md:61
msgid ""
"SDK 发现与实际构造是不同消费边界。后续构造必须检出 SDK "
"字节变化和来源冲突，不能靠持久“已验证”标志跳过。具体规范见[构建合同](../reference/contracts/build-"
"system.md)。"
msgstr ""
"SDK discovery and actual construction are separate consumption boundaries. "
"Later construction must detect SDK byte changes and source conflicts; it "
"cannot skip checks using a persistent \"verified\" flag. See the [build "
"contract](../reference/contracts/build-system.md) for the rules."
